{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121155","id":4026872948,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wBTR0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121155","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121155.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121155.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121155","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121155/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121155/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121155/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/899de04acbb717f9cc55fe1dd42bc679372aa355","number":121155,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash in org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity.updatePiPParams","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Should fix this crash reported on Play Console:\r\nhttps://play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/5310120689138741555/app/4972363226496209566/vitals/crashes/174db51bdcc102766d2681de5176fdbb/details?days=28\r\n```\r\nException java.lang.IllegalStateException:\r\n  at android.os.Parcel.createExceptionOrNull (Parcel.java:3396)\r\n  at android.os.Parcel.createException (Parcel.java:3372)\r\n  at android.os.Parcel.readException (Parcel.java:3355)\r\n  at android.os.Parcel.readException (Parcel.java:3297)\r\n  at android.app.IActivityClientController$Stub$Proxy.setPictureInPictureParams (IActivityClientController.java:2388)\r\n  at android.app.ActivityClient.setPictureInPictureParams (ActivityClient.java:457)\r\n  at android.app.Activity.setPictureInPictureParams (Activity.java:3411)\r\n  at org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity.updatePiPParams (GodotActivity.kt:355)\r\n  at org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity.updatePiPParams$default (GodotActivity.kt:330)\r\n  at org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity.onGodotSetupCompleted$lambda$7 (GodotActivity.kt:252)\r\n  at org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity.$r8$lambda$h9xYV6ssYi8LMRmX1dLLthKEaQs (GodotActivity.kt)\r\n  at org.godotengine.godot.GodotActivity$$ExternalSyntheticLambda5.run (D8$$SyntheticClass)\r\n  at android.os.Handler.handleCallback (Handler.java:1070)\r\n```\r\n\r\nCrash is happening when `updatePiPParams` is called inside `onGodotSetupCompleted`. I think app is still not ready at this point, so we should instead call `updatePiPParams` inside `GodotMainLoopStarted`. However, there's also no reason to call `updatePiPParams` on app start. It is already called everytime app enters pip, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/370b759037cf4bafd8f7904fc31551a5505efd22/platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/GodotActivity.kt#L360-L367\r\n\r\nThis PR removes calling `updatePiPParams` on app start.","labels":[{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","c